                                "sense_id": "577c2ef1-e615-38f4-af7d-985eb3375546",
                                "text": "It may be that the days o' fine follow ane anither fast; or that the foul times linger likewise. But in the end, the figures of fine and foul tottle up, in accord wi' their ordered sum."
